This licence covers the Wanderstacks code and the data we wrote. Book texts,
manuscript scans, photos and quoted excerpts are not ours: each keeps its
holder's licence, recorded in its `licence` field and shown in the credits
panel. Scans are loaded from the holder at view time and never committed here.
Some (Bodleian, e-codices, Trinity) are CC BY-NC: a fork that charges money
must drop those sources.
